    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186204089,
      "id": "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4",
      "title": "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "04a0c707-116d-5f37-822d-77828f08f820",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nI. $-4y+8=-4y-1$\n\nII. $-6y-9=-6y-1$\n\nIII. $4y+4=4y+4$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4y+8 & =-4y-1 \\\\ -4y+8+4y & =-4y-1+4y \\\\ 8 & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $y.$ Therefore, the equation $-4y+8=-4y-1$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-6y-9 & =-6y-1 \\\\ -6y-9+6y & =-6y-1+6y \\\\ -9 & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $y.$ Therefore, the equation $-6y-9=-6y-1$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4y+4 & =4y+4 \\\\ 4y+4-4y & =4y+4-4y \\\\ 4 & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $y.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "31b449fe-f7e7-5c2a-b843-2ab2e4a85dcd",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "3b2cd862-73be-581b-9fee-5f55529a435d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "08804910-8c15-5857-8b89-c2c51affbb33",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "7ee918c4-4438-58b4-a893-5d2331d44b89",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I, II, and III"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "64334c9f-34a8-558c-801f-5cb786c5ce3f",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "ef8ae572-cc5f-5a97-b6b5-b40e79cb49b8",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
