  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186204089,
      "id": "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4",
      "title": "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "ac9fc33e-dfda-580d-9017-73e081f92d1d",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5u+8 & =5u+8 \\\\ 5u+8-5u & =5u+8-5u \\\\ 8 & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $u.$\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9u-5 & =8u-8 \\\\ 9u-5-8u+5 & =8u-8-8u+5 \\\\ u & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $9u-5=8u-8$ has the unique solution $u=-3.$\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8u-4 & =8u+5 \\\\ 8u-4-8u & =8u+5-8u \\\\ -4 & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $u.$ Therefore, the equation $8u-4=8u+5$ has no solutions.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $8u-4=8u+5$ only.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "d4e95922-581e-52a4-8bea-b3cfc442e631",
          ":answer-field/key": "$5u+8=5u+8$",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "5dc20305-8d63-58f4-bbd9-940478d301dc",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
