  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186204089,
      "id": "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4",
      "title": "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "b6ccaf15-9057-53d6-80f4-acf1eef96a6b",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nI. $-3z-7=-3z-7$\n\nII. $-7z-1=-7z+9$\n\nIII. $2z-1=2z+3$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3z-7 & =-3z-7 \\\\ -3z-7+3z & =-3z-7+3z \\\\ -7 & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $z.$\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-7z-1 & =-7z+9 \\\\ -7z-1+7z & =-7z+9+7z \\\\ -1 & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $z.$ Therefore, the equation $-7z-1=-7z+9$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2z-1 & =2z+3 \\\\ 2z-1-2z & =2z+3-2z \\\\ -1 & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $z.$ Therefore, the equation $2z-1=2z+3$ has no solutions.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "34d7328a-c003-5300-831a-2d563ffa66fa",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "edd13411-27fb-5786-868d-d3c3fcfa410c",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "4e955883-dbfa-568c-ab55-6868120bcae2",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I, II, and III"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "28ebcdc8-a08f-57f4-9102-1a1eaaeee0af",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "2f7d18d4-8c79-59b2-96a7-a09c3d159838",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "8f7bd3aa-397c-5b09-97f3-5d9a69bacb3b",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "edd13411-27fb-5786-868d-d3c3fcfa410c"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
