  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186204089,
      "id": "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4",
      "title": "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "12fb7b42-1473-5fbd-a4cc-905a16af6a9d",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nI. $6z+2=-8z-4$\n\nII. $3z+1=3z+1$\n\nIII. $-z+1=-z$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6z+2 & =-8z-4 \\\\ 6z+2+8z-2 & =-8z-4+8z-2 \\\\ 14z & =-6 \\\\ z & =- \\frac{3}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $6z+2=-8z-4$ has the unique solution $z=- \\frac{3}{7}.$\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3z+1 & =3z+1 \\\\ 3z+1-3z & =3z+1-3z \\\\ 1 & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $z.$\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-z+1 & =-z \\\\ -z+1+z & =-z+z \\\\ 1 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $z.$ Therefore, the equation $-z+1=-z$ has no solutions.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "b9257049-af3b-5657-a085-eca0c2373632",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "d10d2856-94c0-5550-9448-3a8168626388",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "07f3511a-b471-53b3-9ad9-f15cb264460a",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "1a1f5575-ea42-51ce-88b3-9513affe1d94",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "3830ed24-d8a8-52a4-9c69-807a7a34fcd6",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I, II, and III"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "3a508f03-7e4e-544e-a72a-6c4a32a5fc0b",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
